@startuml Hinh_2_2_Co_che_giao_tiep_lien_dich_vu
title Hình 2.2: Cơ chế giao tiếp liên dịch vụ trong hệ thống ELP
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam titleFontSize 15
skinparam titleFontStyle bold
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam padding 4
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 24
skinparam ranksep 46
top to bottom direction

rectangle "1. Tầng Trình diễn Client" {
    [React 19 SPA\n(Vite 8 + Zustand + Query)] as Frontend
}

rectangle "2. Tầng Ứng dụng Lõi - Spring Boot 3.2.5 (:8080)" {
    [REST Controllers & Security\n(JWT Dual-Token + RBAC)] as API_GW
    [WebSocket STOMP (/ws)\n(/topic, /queue, /app)] as STOMP
    [RabbitMQ Worker\n(VideoTranscodeConsumer)] as RabbitWorker
}

rectangle "3. Dịch vụ AI Cục bộ (FastAPI) & Cloud AI" {
    [phonetics-service (:8000)\nWav2Vec2 + Praat + Kokoro] as PyPhone
    [writing-scorer (:8001)\nIELTS Task 1/2/Paragraph] as PyWrite
    cloud [Cloud AI Fallback\nGemini 2.5 Flash & Groq] as CloudAI
}

rectangle "4. Tầng Hạ tầng Dữ liệu & Lưu trữ" {
    database "MariaDB / MySQL\n(32 bảng 3NF)" as MySQL
    database "Redis Cache\n(TTL 60 phút)" as Redis
    queue "RabbitMQ\n(video.transcode)" as RabbitMQ
    cloud "Cloudflare R2\n(HLS & Media)" as R2
}

Frontend --> API_GW : HTTPS REST
Frontend <--> STOMP : WSS STOMP
Frontend --> R2 : Streaming HLS

API_GW --> PyPhone : HTTP POST
API_GW --> PyWrite : HTTP POST
API_GW --> CloudAI : HTTPS Tier 2/3

API_GW --> MySQL : JDBC / HikariCP
API_GW --> Redis : Spring Cache
API_GW --> RabbitWorker : Dispatch
RabbitWorker <--> RabbitMQ : AMQP 0-9-1
RabbitWorker --> R2 : S3 Upload HLS
@enduml
